[version]
1.6.2
[date]
2026-10-22
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: update command (and all HTTP-using apps) now work in GUI windows!
  - Root cause: GUI event loop swallowed http_success/http_failure events
  - GUI only delivered key/char/mouse/timer events to windows
  - Apps using http.request() (update, pinestore, webbrowser, wget)
    hung forever waiting for http_success that never arrived
  - Fix: added catch-all that delivers ANY unhandled event to active window
  - This also fixes: websocket_*, peripheral, disk, rednet_message events
[/whatsnew]
[files]
de/gui.lua
latest_update.upd
